  (text "BODY changes the high pass filter cutout frequency. \nDo not implement if C15 is soldered."
    (at 257.81 41.275 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 00e38d63-5436-49db-81f5-697421f168fc)
  )
  (text "Resistors and capacitors change the pitch\nand helps blend more or less of the original \nsignal with the feedback."
    (at 173.355 127.635 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4ba06b66-7669-4c70-b585-f5d4c9c33527)
  )
  (text "Higher C1 value let \nmore bass in. (e.g. 0.47u)" (at 46.355 76.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6cc7c077-7e11-495c-9883-0fbef52c87a3)
  )
  (text "The extension header allows you to use the 4th\npotentiometer as a control for anything else.\nFor instance, instead of soldering the BODY trimpot,\nconnect it to the header to have an external BODY \ncontrol."
    (at 363.22 31.115 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 74b5ea9f-9795-44ad-87a8-5194c7f51e5b)
  )
  (text "Replace D5 or D4 with a jumper\nto use symmetrical clipping."
    (at 194.31 28.575 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a43ea08a-7d64-434a-9a7f-265c4937c26d)
  )
  (text "Asymetric clipping helps\ncompensating for volume drop\nwith some diodes (i.e. germanium).\n\nReplace D6 or D7 with a jumper\nto use symmetrical clipping."
    (at 125.73 28.575 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d4c9471f-7503-4339-928c-d1abae1eede6)
  )

